2026-11-22T19:25:25.9081519Z pluginval - 2.0.0
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9206972Z Tests at strictness level 10:
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9207855Z 
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9208700Z   Plugin info: Logs getName(), getAlternateDisplayNames(), supportsDoublePrecisionProcessing(), getLatencySamples(), getTailLengthSeconds()
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9210447Z   Locale stability: Checks that the plugin doesn't change the system locale. Some plugins or GUI frameworks change locale settings (e.g., decimal separator from '.' to ','). This can corrupt preset files, break float parsing in other plugins, or crash the host
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9212456Z   Plugin programs: Calls getNumPrograms() and getProgramName() for each, then randomly switches programs 5 times via setCurrentProgram()
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9213526Z   Editor: Calls createEditor() twice (cold and warm), logs time taken, expects non-null editor pointer
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9214552Z   Plugin state: Saves state via getStateInformation(), randomises all automatable params, restores via setStateInformation()
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9215868Z   Automatable Parameters: For each non-bypass automatable parameter: logs index, name, defaultValue, label, numSteps, isDiscrete, isBoolean, isAutomatable, category
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9217562Z   Audio processing: Processes 10 blocks at each sample rate / block size combo. For instruments, sends noteOn/noteOff. Checks for NaNs, Infs, subnormals
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9218792Z   Automation: Processes in 32-sample sub-blocks, randomly changing up to 10 params between each. Subnormals treated as errors
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9220070Z   Open editor whilst processing: Starts async thread calling processBlock() repeatedly, then calls createEditor() on message thread. Tests concurrent access
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9222383Z   Bus layout processing: For every supported combination of mono/stereo on each input and output bus (including sidechain), calls setBusesLayout(), prepareToPlay() and processBlock(). Detects crashes in plugins that mis-handle non-default channel counts (e.g. mono main with stereo sidechain).
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9224268Z   Basic bus: Tests audio bus configuration: lists all supported input/output layouts (named channel sets like stereo/5.1 and discrete channels), tests enableAllBuses() and disableNonMainBuses(), then verifies the default layout can be restored
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9225517Z   Editor Automation: With editor open, loops 1000x calling setValue(random) on ALL parameters with 10ms sleep between iterations
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9226253Z   vst3 validator: Runs Steinberg's vstvalidator with -e flag for extended validation (VST3 only)
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9226868Z   auval: Runs 'auval -strict -stress 20 -v <type> <subtype> <manu>' (Audio Units only)
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9228065Z   Fuzz parameters: For each parameter, sets 5 random values and calls getValue(), getText(), getValueForText(), getCurrentValueAsText(). Tests that text/value conversion functions don't crash or hang with arbitrary inputs
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9228937Z   Editor stress
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9229568Z   Plugin state restoration: For each param: saves original value, randomises, restores state, expects value within 0.1 of original. Also requires exact binary state match
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9230600Z   Non-releasing audio processing: Same as audio processing, but calls prepareToPlay() at new sample rate WITHOUT calling releaseResources() first
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9231973Z   Parameter thread safety: Message thread calls setValueNotifyingHost() 500x on all params. Simultaneously, this thread calls setValue() and processBlock() 500x
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9233110Z   Background thread state: Opens editor on message thread. From background thread: getStateInformation(), randomise params, setStateInformation(). Sleeps 2s for async updates
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9234065Z   Parameters: Same as automatable parameters test - logs info for all non-bypass automatable parameters
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9235175Z   Discrete parameter state restoration: For each discrete param: sets a random value, saves state, then restores that state twice - once unchanged and once after setting a different value - and expects the same value both times
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9236121Z   Process called with a larger than prepared block size
2026-11-22T19:25:25.9236448Z   Allocations during process
